cated for renal protection in patients with diabetes and albuminuria/CKD; a **bisphosphonate or other anti-resorptive** is strongly indicated for osteoporosis prevention in an older patient with a prior fragility fracture (vertebral fracture). (Ref: O''Mahony et al., Age Ageing 2015; Hazzard''s Ch. 30)'),
